{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "center",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -200,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "# mattpocock/skills\n\n> Skills for Real Engineers\n> github.com/mattpocock/skills\n\n**22 個 active skills** | Engineering 17 + Productivity 5\n作者：Matt Pocock（Total TypeScript）"
    },
    {
      "id": "philosophy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -200,
      "y": -310,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 設計哲學\n\n1. **小而可組合** — 每個 skill 做一件事\n2. **模型無關** — Claude Code / Codex / Pi 通用\n3. **強調基礎** — TDD、review、領域建模、架構\n4. **人保留控制** — 不強制接管流程"
    },
    {
      "id": "legend",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## 圖例\n\n🟢 **綠色** = ✅ 已安裝\n⚪ **灰色** = 未安裝\n\n**User** = 使用者手動呼叫 `/skill`\n**Model** = agent 可自動選用\n\nUser-invoked 負責**編排流程**\nModel-invoked 持有**可重用紀律**\n\n---\n已安裝 7 / 22"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat-eng-user",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -650,
      "y": -50,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 50,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## 🔧 Engineering — User-invoked"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat-eng-model",
