      "color": "6",
      "text": "## 🛠 Misc / Personal"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-setup",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -950,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### ✅ setup-matt-pocock-skills\n\n初始化設定\nissue tracker / labels\n**每個 repo 跑一次**"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-grill-me",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -950,
      "y": 130,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### ✅ grill-me\n\n深度追問\n把需求問清楚再動手"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-to-spec",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -950,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### ✅ to-spec\n\n對話 → 規格書\n自動發到 issue tracker"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-to-tickets",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -950,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### ✅ to-tickets\n\nSpec → Tracer-bullet tickets\n每張標明 blocking edges"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-implement",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -950,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### implement\n\n依照 spec/tickets 實作\n驅動 TDD + code review"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-wayfinder",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -950,
      "y": -80,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### wayfinder\n\n規劃大型工作\n跨多 session 的 investigation tickets"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-triage",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -650,
      "y": -130,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### triage\n\nIssue 分流狀態機"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-improve-arch",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -650,
      "y": 130,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### ✅ improve-codebase-architecture\n\n掃描 codebase 架構\n產生 HTML 報告"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-ask-matt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -380,
      "y": -130,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### ask-matt\n\n路由器\n推薦該用哪個 skill"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-grill-with-docs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 140,
      "y": -140,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### grill-with-docs\n\n深度追問 + 領域建模\n自動建 CONTEXT.md + ADR"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-tdd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -950,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### ✅ tdd\n\n紅-綠-重構 TDD 循環\n一次一個 vertical slice"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-code-review",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -950,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### ✅ code-review\n\n雙軸 review\nStandards + Spec 並行"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-diagnosing",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -950,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### diagnosing-bugs\n\n紀律化 bug 診斷\nreproduce → minimise → fix"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-prototype",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -650,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### prototype\n\n建 throwaway prototype\n驗證設計問題"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-research",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -650,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### research\n\n深度調查\n產出引用式 Markdown"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-domain",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -650,
      "y": 840,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### domain-modeling\n\n建立專案領域模型\n挑戰術語 + 更新 CONTEXT.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-codebase-design",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -380,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### codebase-design\n\n設計 deep modules\n大量行為藏在小介面後"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-merge",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -380,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### resolving-merge-conflicts\n\n逐 hunk 解決 git conflict\n追溯 intent 到原始來源"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-grilling",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 470,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### grilling\n\n追問的核心循環\n被 grill-me / grill-with-docs 呼叫"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-handoff",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### handoff\n\n對話 → 交接文件\n供另一個 agent 續作"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-teach",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### teach\n\n多 session 教學\n用目錄當狀態化工作區"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-writing",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### writing-great-skills\n\n如何寫好 skill\n參考指南"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -200,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 📋 典型工作流\n\n```\n/grill-me → 搞清楚需求\n    ↓\n/to-spec → 產出規格書\n    ↓\n/to-tickets → 拆成 tickets\n    ↓\n/implement → 逐個實作（自動觸發 /tdd + /code-review）\n    ↓\n/improve-codebase-architecture → 定期維護\n```"
    }
  ],
